\begin{equation*}
\Omega^{k,0}\stackrel{\dv }{\longrightarrow}
\Omega^{k,1}\stackrel{\dv }{\longrightarrow}
\Omega^{k,2}\stackrel{\dv }{\longrightarrow}
\cdots
\end{equation*}
is exact.

diagnostic_evidence.quote:
